---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="自研项目与开源作品 - 庄谷 (charmlynn)"
  description="庄谷 (charmlynn) 的自研产品与开源工具展台，包括面向开发者的本地优先 AI 知识库 SaveAnswer 等。"
>
  <div class="space-y-10">
    <div class="space-y-2 border-b border-zinc-800/60 pb-6">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-100">项目展台</h1>
      <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
        平时根据自己的痛点与真实工作流打磨的工具产品。推崇本地优先、数据私有与极致效能。
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Active Projects List -->
    <div class="space-y-8">
      <!-- Project 1: SaveAnswer -->
      <article class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/30 p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-6 hover:border-zinc-700 transition-colors">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <img
              src="/saveanswer/assets/icon.png"
              alt="SaveAnswer Icon"
              class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl border border-zinc-700/50 bg-zinc-950 p-1"
            />
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-100">SaveAnswer</h2>
                <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-mono bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-400 border border-blue-500/20">v1.1.0</span>
                <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-mono bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/20">已上线</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs text-zinc-400 font-mono mt-0.5">面向开发者的本地优先 AI 知识库 Chrome 扩展</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <a
              href="/saveanswer/"
              class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-zinc-700 bg-zinc-800/80 hover:bg-zinc-700 text-zinc-200 text-xs font-medium transition-colors"
            >
              访问项目推广页 →
            </a>
            <a
              href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/saveanswer-save-ai-answer/iminapemlncanmmaadedieifgkaeoljm"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white text-xs font-medium transition-colors"
            >
              Chrome 商店安装
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-sm text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
          原生内嵌 ChatGPT、Claude、DeepSeek、Gemini、通义千问、Grok、豆包。支持 420px 弹窗敏捷秒查、三栏桌面工作台深度研读与直写本地 Obsidian。零云端服务器，数据 100% 掌握在自己手中。
        </p>

        <!-- Preview Image -->
        <a href="/saveanswer/" class="block rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950 hover:border-zinc-700 transition-colors">
          <img
            src="/saveanswer/assets/workspace-preview.png"
            alt="SaveAnswer 工作台"
            class="w-full h-auto object-cover"
          />
        </a>

        <!-- Feature Points Matrix -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs text-zinc-400 pt-2">
          <div class="p-3 rounded-lg border border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-900/40">
            <strong class="text-zinc-200 block mb-1">⚡ 多大模型原生内嵌</strong>
            <span>在各个 AI 网页回复末尾无缝插入一键保存按钮，一秒提取结构化 Markdown 与元数据。</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 rounded-lg border border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-900/40">
            <strong class="text-zinc-200 block mb-1">💎 Obsidian 本地 Vault 直连</strong>
            <span>通过浏览器原生文件系统直写本地笔记目录，不依赖任何第三方服务器中转。</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 rounded-lg border border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-900/40">
            <strong class="text-zinc-200 block mb-1">🖥️ 双形态自由切换</strong>
            <span>随时唤起的 420px 浮窗快捷检索 + 全宽标签页三栏工作台深入研读。</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 rounded-lg border border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-900/40">
            <strong class="text-zinc-200 block mb-1">🔒 真正的零遥测隐私保障</strong>
            <span>无需注册登录，数据完全留存在你的本地硬盘，即使离线断网也完全可用。</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Project 2: charmlynn.github.io -->
      <article class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 bg-zinc-900/20 p-6 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-zinc-800 border border-zinc-700/60 flex items-center justify-center font-mono text-zinc-300 text-sm">
              🌐
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-zinc-200">charmlynn.github.io</h2>
                <span class="px-2 py-0.2 rounded text-[10px] font-mono bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-400 border border-zinc-700/60">开源</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs text-zinc-400 mt-0.5">个人极简独立网站与博客系统</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <a
            href="https://github.com/charmlynn/charmlynn.github.io"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-xs text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-200 font-mono"
          >
            GitHub 源码 →
          </a>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
          基于 Astro + Tailwind CSS 构建。静态优先、默认零 JS 运行时、极致访问速度。支持自动化 CI/CD 部署到 GitHub Pages，且无缝保留子路径产品落地页。
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-500">
          <span>Astro 7</span>
          <span>·</span>
          <span>Tailwind v4</span>
          <span>·</span>
          <span>Content Collections</span>
          <span>·</span>
          <span>GitHub Actions</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Upcoming Project Card Placeholder -->
      <article class="rounded-xl border border-dashed border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950/40 p-6 space-y-2 text-center sm:text-left">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-2">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-400/80"></span>
            <h2 class="text-sm font-medium text-zinc-300">More Tools & AI Experiments in Progress...</h2>
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs text-zinc-500 font-mono">Building</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500">
          更多专注于本地知识图谱、大模型工具链与自动化流水线的独立工具正在酝酿中，敬请期待。
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
